  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:03.790" end="00:05.290" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Run it back)</p>
      <p begin="00:04.370" end="00:05.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(To the back)</p>
      <p begin="00:04.950" end="00:06.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Run it, run it back)</p>
      <p begin="00:05.890" end="00:08.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Run it to the back)</p>
      <p begin="00:08.600" end="00:10.100" ttm:agent="v1">You got me restless</p>
      <p begin="00:09.730" end="00:11.800" ttm:agent="v1">Think I'm looking for a death wish</p>
      <p begin="00:11.800" end="00:13.300" ttm:agent="v1">Feel so helpless</p>
      <p begin="00:13.160" end="00:17.090" ttm:agent="v1">As you lead me to demise</p>
      <p begin="00:17.090" end="00:18.590" ttm:agent="v1">And you're so selfish</p>
      <p begin="00:18.180" end="00:20.490" ttm:agent="v1">When it hurts, you're MIA</p>
      <p begin="00:20.490" end="00:22.540" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause you hate to hear commitment</p>
      <p begin="00:22.540" end="00:25.110" ttm:agent="v1">Three more words, what can I say?</p>
      <p begin="00:25.110" end="00:26.910" ttm:agent="v1">Ohhhhh</p>
      <p begin="00:26.910" end="00:29.190" ttm:agent="v1">I'm a fool to let you come in</p>
      <p begin="00:29.190" end="00:33.620" ttm:agent="v1">You say I'm like your ex, and you can't tell me why</p>
      <p begin="00:33.620" end="00:35.730" ttm:agent="v1">Ohhhhh</p>
      <p begin="00:35.730" end="00:37.700" ttm:agent="v1">Gave all my excuses</p>
      <p begin="00:37.700" end="00:39.230" ttm:agent="v1">Say we're not exclusive</p>
      <p begin="00:39.230" end="00:42.050" ttm:agent="v1">'Cause you ain't satisfied</p>
      <p begin="00:42.050" end="00:43.550" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, girl</p>
      <p begin="00:43.010" end="00:44.510" ttm:agent="v1">Who's to blame</p>
      <p begin="00:44.130" end="00:47.020" ttm:agent="v1">Trigger fingers locked in my sight</p>
      <p begin="00:47.020" end="00:50.450" ttm:agent="v1">All bark and no bite</p>
      <p begin="00:50.450" end="00:51.950" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, girl</p>
      <p begin="00:51.530" end="00:53.030" ttm:agent="v1">Who's to blame</p>
      <p begin="00:52.560" end="00:55.900" ttm:agent="v1">I'm the one that started the fight</p>
      <p begin="00:55.900" end="00:58.600" ttm:agent="v1">But you're the first to feed the fire</p>
      <p begin="00:58.600" end="01:00.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Run it back)</p>
      <p begin="00:59.060" end="01:00.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(To the back)</p>
      <p begin="01:00.080" end="01:01.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Run it back)</p>
      <p begin="01:00.590" end="01:02.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Run it, run it back)</p>
      <p begin="01:01.850" end="01:03.350" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, aye, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:02.940" end="01:04.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Run it back)</p>
      <p begin="01:03.350" end="01:04.850" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(To the back)</p>
      <p begin="01:03.950" end="01:05.450" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Run it back)</p>
      <p begin="01:04.550" end="01:06.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Run it, run it—)</p>
      <p begin="01:05.380" end="01:06.950" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Running fucking back (To the back)</p>
      <p begin="01:06.950" end="01:08.450" ttm:agent="v1">I want what I like</p>
      <p begin="01:08.010" end="01:09.510" ttm:agent="v1">You talk what I like</p>
      <p begin="01:09.180" end="01:10.680" ttm:agent="v1">The feelings aren't light</p>
      <p begin="01:10.120" end="01:11.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'm feeling alright (Uh)</p>
      <p begin="01:11.630" end="01:13.130" ttm:agent="v1">My type</p>
      <p begin="01:12.240" end="01:13.740" ttm:agent="v1">She growls and I bite</p>
      <p begin="01:13.270" end="01:14.770" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, how we're alike</p>
      <p begin="01:14.380" end="01:15.990" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">But girl, you a liar (Uh)</p>
      <p begin="01:15.990" end="01:17.490" ttm:agent="v1">Wanna talk about it</p>
      <p begin="01:16.580" end="01:18.080" ttm:agent="v1">Nah forget it</p>
      <p begin="01:17.420" end="01:19.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Rather feign ignorance than my innocence (Yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:19.830" end="01:21.880" ttm:agent="v1">Begging on my knees, I'm like baby please</p>
      <p begin="01:21.880" end="01:23.380" ttm:agent="v1">I wanna be a couple</p>
      <p begin="01:22.680" end="01:24.180" ttm:agent="v1">Not as enemies</p>
      <p begin="01:23.900" end="01:25.910" ttm:agent="v1">You're so fine, gotta kick it witcha</p>
      <p begin="01:25.910" end="01:27.970" ttm:agent="v1">No hasta luego, andele</p>
      <p begin="01:27.970" end="01:30.030" ttm:agent="v1">Like seaside, you know I be dealing with ya</p>
      <p begin="01:30.030" end="01:32.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Baby, pick up the phone, I be on the way (On the way)</p>
      <p begin="01:32.360" end="01:33.860" ttm:agent="v1">Hold up, hold up</p>
      <p begin="01:33.430" end="01:34.930" ttm:agent="v1">Roll up, roll up</p>
      <p begin="01:34.550" end="01:36.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Baby, it's just one life (It's just one life)</p>
      <p begin="01:36.250" end="01:37.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Uh)</p>
      <p begin="01:36.890" end="01:38.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Would you be down one night (One night)</p>
      <p begin="01:38.370" end="01:39.870" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:38.860" end="01:40.360" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me, is you gon' be mine?</p>
      <p begin="01:40.270" end="01:41.770" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Woof)</p>
      <p begin="01:40.860" end="01:42.360" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, girl</p>
      <p begin="01:41.820" end="01:43.320" ttm:agent="v1">Who's to blame</p>
      <p begin="01:42.920" end="01:45.850" ttm:agent="v1">Trigger fingers locked in my sight</p>
      <p begin="01:45.850" end="01:49.150" ttm:agent="v1">All bark and no bite</p>
      <p begin="01:49.150" end="01:50.650" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, girl</p>
      <p begin="01:50.180" end="01:51.680" ttm:agent="v1">Who's to blame</p>
      <p begin="01:51.260" end="01:54.690" ttm:agent="v1">I'm the one that started the fight</p>
      <p begin="01:54.690" end="01:57.320" ttm:agent="v1">But you're the first to feed the fire</p>
      <p begin="01:57.320" end="01:58.820" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Run it back)</p>
      <p begin="01:57.980" end="01:59.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(To the back)</p>
      <p begin="01:58.330" end="01:59.830" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(To the—run it back)</p>
      <p begin="01:59.280" end="02:00.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Run it, run it)</p>
      <p begin="01:59.860" end="02:01.830" ttm:agent="v1">First to feed the fire</p>
      <p begin="02:01.830" end="02:03.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Back)</p>
      <p begin="02:02.280" end="02:03.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(To the back)</p>
      <p begin="02:03.180" end="02:04.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Run it back)</p>
      <p begin="02:03.660" end="02:05.160" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Run it, run it)</p>
      <p begin="02:04.270" end="02:06.060" ttm:agent="v1">Who's the one to blame?</p>
      <p begin="02:06.060" end="02:07.560" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, girl</p>
      <p begin="02:07.160" end="02:08.660" ttm:agent="v1">Who's to blame</p>
      <p begin="02:08.260" end="02:11.130" ttm:agent="v1">Trigger fingers locked in my sight</p>
